#: ../../language/attributes/export_name.md:1
msgid "Export Name Attribute"
msgstr "导出名称属性"

#: ../../language/attributes/export_name.md:3
msgid ""
"The `#export_name` attribute assigns a stable exported symbol name to a "
"public function in a package declared with `pkgtype(kind: "
"\"foreign_library\")`. The name is used in generated Wasm, JavaScript, or"
" C output:"
msgstr ""
"`#export_name` 属性为使用 `pkgtype(kind: \"foreign_library\")` "
"声明的包中的公开函数指定稳定的导出符号名称。该名称用于生成的 Wasm、JavaScript 或 C 输出："

#: ../../language/attributes/export_name.md:7
msgid ""
"#export_name(\"add\")\n"
"pub fn add_one(value : Int) -> Int {\n"
"  value + 1\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/attributes/export_name.md:14
msgid ""
"MoonBit currently requires the exported name to be unique within the "
"package and to be a valid C symbol identifier, regardless of the selected"
" backend."
msgstr "MoonBit 目前要求导出名在包内唯一，并且无论选择哪个后端，都必须是有效的 C 符号标识符。"

#: ../../language/attributes/export_name.md:18
msgid ""
"Known compiler issue: `#export_name` currently applies its C-symbol-"
"identifier restriction to every backend. WebAssembly export names are "
"UTF-8 strings and are not limited to C identifiers."
msgstr ""
"已知编译器问题：`#export_name` 目前会对所有后端施加 C 符号标识符限制。WebAssembly 导出名是 UTF-8 "
"字符串，并不限于 C 标识符。"

#: ../../language/attributes/export_name.md:23
msgid ""
"The attribute cannot be used on generic functions, functions with "
"optional arguments, methods, or declarations without a body."
msgstr "该属性不能用于泛型函数、带可选参数的函数、方法或没有函数体的声明。"

#: ../../language/attributes/export_name.md:26
msgid ""
"Prefer `#export_name` over backend-specific `exports` link configuration "
"for new exports. It keeps the exported name next to the function and "
"applies to every backend that supports foreign-library output. Use "
"`exports` when the export set or names must differ by backend, or when "
"the source cannot be annotated."
msgstr ""
"对于新的导出，优先使用 `#export_name`，而不是各后端的 `exports` "
"链接配置。它将导出名称放在函数旁，并适用于所有支持外部库输出的后端。当导出集合或名称需要因后端而异，或者无法修改源代码添加属性时，使用 "
"`exports`。"

#: ../../language/attributes/export_name.md:32
msgid ""
"Export declarations are scoped to the package that produces the artifact."
" An attribute in a dependency applies when that dependency is built as "
"its own artifact, but it does not add a symbol to a downstream package's "
"artifact. To expose dependency functionality, define and export a wrapper"
" in the exporting package."
msgstr "导出声明的作用域是生成产物的包。依赖中的属性在该依赖自身构建为产物时生效，但不会向下游包的产物添加符号。若要暴露依赖的功能，请在执行导出的包中定义并导出一个包装函数。"

#: ../../language/attributes/export_name.md:39
msgid ""
"The native backend does not currently support exporting a "
"`foreign_library` package as a library artifact. Use Wasm or JavaScript "
"if you need an exported library."
msgstr "native 后端目前不支持将 `foreign_library` 包导出为库产物。如需导出的库，请使用 Wasm 或 JavaScript。"

#: ../../language/attributes/export_name.md:44
msgid ""
"See [Export Functions](/language/ffi.md#export-functions) for backend-"
"specific alternatives."
msgstr "有关各后端的替代方式，请参阅[导出函数](/language/ffi.md#export-functions)。"

